  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The prefix ter-",
     "texto": [
      "In examples such as **tertinggal** (\"to be left behind\") and **tertelan** (\"to swallow by accident\"), **ter-** presents an unintended action. It doesn't have that meaning in every word with **ter-**.",
      "For English speakers, this is often rendered as \"I left...\": **Berkasnya tertinggal** = \"I left the application file behind.\""
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The circumfix ke-…-an",
     "texto": [
      "In **ketiduran** (\"to fall asleep by accident\") and **kejatuhan** (\"to have something fall on one\"), **ke-…-an** also expresses an involuntary event. The meaning is learned word by word; it isn't added freely to any root."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
